{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-18T10:27:17.271Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"f44ff4fa82c07c16f4f044ac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-18T10:27:17.271Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-18T10:27:17.271Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Fixed the shared cause: status accepts an optional refreshCache flag (default true); all eight internal mutation-preflight callers disable cache publication. Normal public status still warms verified observations. Real cold-index regressions age filesystem entries beyond RACY_WINDOW_NS, then prove switch/reset/undo/attached-rewrite/detached-rewrite and overlapping text refusal retain raw index, refs, HEAD, operation log and private bytes. Tracker-linked command node --test --test-name-pattern=\"renewed private layer refuses|collapsed text\" test/composition.test.ts test/first-class-conflicts.test.ts passes 7/7; public cache-warming regression passes 1/1. Behavioral revert: remove only refreshCache from the cache-publication condition, leaving all callers/tests fixed. Layer suite yields 3 pass/3 fail (switch and both rewrites mutate index); collapsed-text refusal yields 0/1 pass with the same raw-index mutation. Restored protection; typecheck, lint, zero duplication and docstrings pass. Initial single-operation preflight ordering was discarded because it left rewrite and conflict-resolution refusals exposed."}]}],"before_hash":"7dd951b010f5ad71b2edae4b2cd152b50e4a64a32f8d08c43ba815bd9b89b9bf","after_hash":"67b67f280ffbbcf54f160c8e6f24a1f8e2a896c111af20ba3536b99a8309e999","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"3ac3e2208cb57ff4d5b90c412ff96cbb27d02bc23cf157a41bb48f1d1d403269"}
